  "worked_solution": "First, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $z,$ treating $x$ and $y$ as constants: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}{\\int }_{0}^{y}xyz\\,dz\\,dy\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}[{\\int }_{0}^{y}xyz\\,dz]dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}{[\\frac{1}{2}xy{z}^{2}]}_{z=0}^{z=y}\\,dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{1}{2}xy({y}^{2}-0)\\,dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{1}{2}x{y}^{3}\\,dy\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $y,$ treating $x$ as a constant: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{1}{2}x{y}^{3}\\,dy\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}[{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{1}{2}x{y}^{3}\\,dy]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{[\\frac{1}{8}x{y}^{4}]}_{y=0}^{y=x}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{8}x({x}^{4}-0)\\,dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{x}^{5}\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{8}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{x}^{5}\\,dx & =\\frac{1}{8}{[\\frac{1}{6}{x}^{6}]}_{x=0}^{x=2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{48}(64-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
